gEe(){return"Relax your shoulders and hands; tension wastes energy."},
gEf(){return"Replace your shoes when the soles look worn or new aches appear."},
gE4(){return"Rest is part of the plan: muscle gets stronger while you recover."},
gE5(){return"Sleeping 7 to 9 hours improves recovery and performance."},
